{"_meta":{"securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["record:read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Read the decision journal"},"description":"Read the investor's decision journal, newest first. Useful when the investor asks what they decided or wrote, or when a review is due. Page with before and before_id. reviews_due_only selects due entries without verdicts whose linked thesis version, if present, is active. Attribute verbatim text to the investor. Follow agent_reflection_id via get_reflection_history({ id }). Ask for the investor's observation before quoting the original in a due review. Reviews are saved in Investboard.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"before":{"description":"A timestamp alone resumes at millisecond precision and may skip rows sharing that millisecond: send before_id with it.","format":"date-time","type":"string"},"before_id":{"description":"An entry id from this journal. A marker this journal does not recognize answers an empty page, which is not the end of the journal; restart from the newest page.","format":"uuid","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Maximum journal entries per page.","maximum":50,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"reviews_due_only":{"description":"Only overdue entries still awaiting the investor's review.","type":"boolean"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_journal","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"agent_reflection_id":{"anyOf":[{"format":"uuid","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"conviction":{"anyOf":[{"maximum":5,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},{"type":"null"}]},"created_at":{"format":"date-time","pattern":"^(?:(?:\\d\\d[2468][048]|\\d\\d[13579][26]|\\d\\d0[48]|[02468][048]00|[13579][26]0